    "semantic_summary": "TextInputInspector is a presentation layer Angular component designed to manage interactive text or numerical input within an editor's inspector panel. It accepts configuration via @Input() properties like 'label', 'value', and 'isNumber', and communicates state changes via the 'change' @Output(). It supports two primary interaction modes: standard text input via onChange and numerical manipulation via drag gestures handled by onDrag, ensuring data integrity through scaling and precision rounding."
